sets.setup:
Seven people attended a conference: four ship captains — **L, M, N and O** — and three first assistants — **A, D and G** (so exactly one captain attended without a first assistant). Each person in turn delivered a report, one after another, subject to:

(i) each first assistant delivered their report **immediately after** their own captain;

(ii) the first captain to speak was **M**, and captain **N** spoke at some point after M.
